Add a function to resolve the user locale without a context. Does the same as `init_i18n_context().get_locale_untracked()` without creating unnecessary reactive values.

This is usefull to access a user locale in a server function, allowing:

```rust
#[server]
async fn get_locale() -> Result<Locale, ServerFnError> {
    let locale = leptos_i18n::locale::resolve_locale();
    Ok(locale)
}
```

close #187

